57
00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.410 line:15%
I wanted to give back in some way

58
00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.800 line:15%
and I figured might as well give back food.

59
00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.020 line:15%
Right now, we're up to nearly 5,000 bagels donated.

60
00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:23.210
A lot of this is also like,

61
00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.320
