62
00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:26.250
because I know how many people are out there

63
00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:27.740
who need food, who are struggling.

64
00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:28.870
It's a little bit extra work,

65
00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.320
but it's definitely worth it.

66
00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:34.500
(upbeat funky music)

67
00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.928
Hey Drew,

68
00:02:35.928 --> 00:02:36.761 line:15%
