88
00:03:10.711 --> 00:03:12.293
Oh, Drew-gooder! That looks so good.

89
00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:16.070
Wow. Oh my God, flowers.

90
00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:17.140
There you go.
Wow.

