100
00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:38.840 line:15%
It's like one in five people don't know

101
00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:40.390 line:15%
where they're getting their next meal problem.from.

102
00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:43.160 line:15%
And COVID only made that like, a bigger problem.

103
00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.660 line:15%
So when I had the idea to just bring bagels

104
00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:46.493 line:15%
