174
00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.400 line:15%
Like a scallion cream cheese,

175
00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:04.210 line:15%
oh, give it to me

176
00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.300 line:15%
But to see someone like that,

177
00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:07.680 line:15%
